  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "import",
      "title": "Import",
      "members": [],
      "paragraphs": [
        "Every asset type known to the engine, keyed by its `type` string.",
        "Extension packages add their own via declaration merging. An entry declares the runtime `resource` it produces and the `config` it accepts; it may also carry `isValue: true` to mirror a binding whose leaf is a deferred AssetRef rather than a heal-in-place handle - required whenever `defineAsset` is called without a `seamless` adapter (see ValueAssetKind)."
      ],
      "importLine": "import { AssetDefinitions } from '@codexo/exojs'",
      "sourceLink": null
    },
